---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/portfolio';
---

<Layout title="소개 | 박규태" description="연세대학교 수학과 박규태. 대수학과 정수론을 공부하며, 수학적 아이디어를 모델과 코드로 구현합니다." isWide={true}>
  <article class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark" aria-hidden="true">∴</span> Mathematics · Modeling · Computation</p>
        <h1 id="about-title">박규태<span class="name-period">.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-statement">수학의 구조를 공부하고,<br /><em>현실의 질문을 모델로 만듭니다.</em></p>
        <div class="hero-bottom">
          <p>연세대학교 수학과에서 대수학과 정수론을 공부합니다. 추상적인 아이디어가 실제 문제를 설명하는 순간에 관심이 있습니다.</p>
          <a class="hero-link" href="#work">작업 살펴보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait-frame">
        <img src="/avatar.webp" alt="박규태의 프로필 사진" width="540" height="660" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <figcaption><span>SEOUL, KR</span><span>MATHEMATICS · 2024—</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="hero-index" aria-hidden="true">PROFILE / 01</div>
    </section>

    <section class="focus-section" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>01</span><p>What I study</p></div>
      <div class="focus-content">
        <h2 id="focus-title">관심은 두 방향으로<br />이어집니다.</h2>
        <div class="focus-list">
          <article class="focus-row">
            <span class="focus-number">A</span>
            <div><h3>대수학과 정수론</h3><p>대수적 구조가 수론의 문제를 어떻게 정리하고 풀어내는지 공부합니다. 장기적으로는 대수적 정수론과 수학적 암호학을 연구하고 싶습니다.</p></div>
            <span class="focus-tags">ALGEBRA / NUMBER THEORY</span>
          </article>
          <article class="focus-row">
            <span class="focus-number">B</span>
            <div><h3>확률 모델과 계산</h3><p>확률·통계와 최적화를 사용해 문제를 모델링하고, 데이터와 코드로 가정을 검토합니다. 최근에는 관계형 데이터와 그래프 기반 머신러닝을 공부하고 있습니다.</p></div>
            <span class="focus-tags">STATISTICS / GRAPH ML</span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="work-section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>02</span><p>Selected work</p></div>
      <div class="work-content">
        <div class="work-heading">
          <div><p class="work-overline">PERSONAL PROJECT · DECISION SCIENCE</p><h2 id="work-title">Yonsei Mileage</h2></div>
          <p class="work-subtitle">Course Registration<br />Decision System</p>
        </div>
        <a class="work-visual" href="/projects/yonsei-mileage/" aria-label="Yonsei Mileage 프로젝트 자세히 보기">
          <img src="/images/yonsei-mileage/figure-01-service-overview.png" alt="Yonsei Mileage 수강신청 도구의 시간표와 마일리지 배분 화면" width="1706" height="1115" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <span class="visual-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <div class="work-foot">
          <p>제한된 마일리지를 원하는 과목에 어떻게 나눌까? 과거 수강신청 데이터로 과목별 성공 가능성을 추정하고, 선호도와 예산을 반영해 배분안을 비교하는 도구를 만들었습니다.</p>
          <div class="work-links">
            <a href="/projects/yonsei-mileage/">프로젝트 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a href={profile.github + '/yonsei-timetable'} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="education-section" aria-labelledby="education-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>03</span><p>Background</p></div>
      <div class="education-content">
        <h2 id="education-title">배우는 과정도<br />기록합니다.</h2>
        <div class="education-detail"><span>2024 — PRESENT</span><h3>Yonsei University</h3><p>B.S. in Mathematics</p></div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">공부 노트 읽기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="about-contact">
      <p class="contact-label">Have a question or an idea?</p>
      <div class="contact-main"><h2>이야기를 나눠요.</h2><a href="mailto:rbparkxo@yonsei.ac.kr">이메일 보내기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="contact-meta"><span>MATHEMATICS · MODELING · COMPUTATION</span><a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GITHUB ↗</a></div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    --page-ink: #172421;
    --page-muted: #69736d;
    --page-accent: #bf5a35;
    --page-line: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-color) 18%, transparent);
    color: var(--text-color);
    padding: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4.75rem) 0 2rem;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .about-page { --page-ink: #edf1eb; --page-muted: #a5ada5; --page-accent: #e79570; }
  .about-hero { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(260px, .72fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem); min-height: min(740px, calc(100svh - 8rem)); padding: 0 0 clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .eyebrow, .section-kicker, .hero-index, .portrait-frame figcaption, .work-overline, .focus-tags, .education-detail > span, .contact-label, .contact-meta { font-family: var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .7rem; }
  .eyebrow-mark { color: var(--page-accent); font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .about-hero h1 { margin: 0 0 1.3rem; color: var(--page-ink); font-size: clamp(5.4rem, 13vw, 11.5rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: .84; letter-spacing: -.105em; }
  .name-period { color: var(--page-accent); }
  .hero-statement { margin: 0; color: var(--page-ink); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: -.06em; word-break: keep-all; }
  .hero-statement em { color: var(--page-accent); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.12em; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .hero-bottom { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2rem; max-width: 700px; margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .hero-bottom p { max-width: 430px; margin: 0; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.9; word-break: keep-all; }
  .hero-link, .text-link, .work-links a, .contact-main a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; min-height: 44px; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; color: var(--page-ink); font-size: .82rem; white-space: nowrap; transition: color .2s ease, gap .2s ease; }
  .hero-link:hover, .text-link:hover, .work-links a:hover, .contact-main a:hover { gap: 1rem; color: var(--page-accent); }
  .portrait-frame { position: relative; align-self: center; margin: 0; }
  .portrait-frame img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 38%; filter: saturate(.75); }
  .portrait-frame figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: .5rem; padding-top: .8rem; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .58rem; }
  .hero-index { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 2.5rem; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .62rem; }

  .focus-section, .work-section, .education-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(120px, .32fr) minmax(0, 1.68fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem); padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--page-line); }
  .section-kicker { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .8rem; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .65rem; }
  .section-kicker span { color: var(--page-accent); }
  .section-kicker p { margin: 0; }
  .focus-content { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
  .focus-content > h2, .education-content > h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--page-ink); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.07em; word-break: keep-all; }
  .focus-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--page-line); }
  .focus-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr; gap: 0 1.1rem; padding: 1.45rem 0 1.65rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--page-line); }
  .focus-number { grid-row: span 2; padding-top: .2rem; color: var(--page-accent); font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .focus-row h3 { margin: 0 0 .55rem; color: var(--page-ink); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .focus-row p { max-width: 570px; margin: 0; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.8; word-break: keep-all; }
  .focus-tags { grid-column: 2; margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .56rem; }

  .work-section { scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
  .work-content { min-width: 0; }
  .work-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .work-overline { margin: 0 0 .7rem; color: var(--page-accent); font-size: .61rem; }
  .work-heading h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--page-ink); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.3rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
  .work-subtitle { margin: 0 0 .35rem; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.6; text-align: right; }
  .work-visual { position: relative; display: block; overflow: hidden; background: #121212; }
  .work-visual img { display: block; width: 100%; height: clamp(250px, 43vw, 560px); object-fit: cover; object-position: center 20%; transition: transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
  .work-visual:hover img { transform: scale(1.025); }
  .visual-arrow { position: absolute; right: 1rem; bottom: 1rem; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 3rem; height: 3rem; background: #f4f2ed; color: #172421; font-size: 1.2rem; transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease; }
  .work-visual:hover .visual-arrow { background: var(--page-accent); color: white; }
  .work-foot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; align-items: start; gap: 2rem; padding-top: 1.3rem; }
  .work-foot > p { max-width: 650px; margin: 0; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.8; word-break: keep-all; }
  .work-links { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 1.6rem; }

  .education-content { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto; align-items: end; gap: 2rem; }
  .education-detail > span { display: block; margin-bottom: .75rem; color: var(--page-accent); font-size: .6rem; }
  .education-detail h3 { margin: 0 0 .25rem; color: var(--page-ink); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .education-detail p { margin: 0; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .86rem; }

  .about-contact { margin: 2rem 0 0; padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--page-line); text-align: left; }
  .contact-label { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .62rem; }
  .contact-main { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .contact-main h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--page-ink); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.08em; }
  .contact-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--page-line); color: var(--page-muted); font-size: .58rem; }
  .contact-meta a:hover { color: var(--page-accent); }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-hero { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(180px, .75fr); gap: 2rem; min-height: auto; padding-bottom: 5rem; }
    .about-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(5rem, 15vw, 8rem); }
    .hero-statement { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2rem); }
    .hero-bottom { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
    .focus-section, .work-section, .education-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .focus-content { grid-template-columns: .7fr 1.3fr; }
    .education-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .education-content .text-link { grid-column: 2; justify-self: start; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .about-page { padding-top: 1rem; }
    .about-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: 4.5rem; }
    .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 2.2rem; font-size: .58rem; }
    .about-hero h1 { margin-bottom: 1.1rem; font-size: clamp(5rem, 23vw, 7rem); }
    .hero-statement { font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 7vw, 2rem); }
    .hero-bottom { margin-top: 1.4rem; }
    .hero-bottom p { font-size: .88rem; }
    .portrait-frame { width: 70%; justify-self: end; }
    .portrait-frame img { aspect-ratio: 5 / 4; }
    .hero-index { bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .focus-section, .work-section, .education-section { padding: 3rem 0; }
    .focus-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.8rem; }
    .focus-content > h2, .education-content > h2 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
    .work-heading { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .work-heading h2 { font-size: 3.5rem; }
    .work-subtitle { text-align: left; }
    .work-visual img { height: 58vw; object-position: left top; }
    .work-foot { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .5rem; }
    .work-links { justify-content: flex-start; gap: 1.3rem; }
    .education-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .education-content .text-link { grid-column: auto; }
    .contact-main { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .contact-meta { font-size: .48rem; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-link, .text-link, .work-links a, .contact-main a, .work-visual img, .visual-arrow { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
